{"id":"strafe","lemma":"Strafe","pos":"noun","rank":1615,"glosses":["punishment","penalty","fine"],"ipa":"/ˈʃtʁaːfə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/33/De-Strafe.OGG/De-Strafe.OGG.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Strafe","plural":"Strafen"},"examples":[{"text":"Strafe die Kinder nicht!","en":"Don't punish the children.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761047","words":[null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Ich musste einen Dollar Strafe zahlen.","en":"I was fined a dollar.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"dollar"},null,{"g":"to pay"}]},{"text":"Wie lange willst du mich noch mit Schweigen strafen?","en":"How long are you going to keep giving me the silent treatment?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"silence"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe die Strafe noch nicht bezahlt.","en":"I haven't paid the fine yet.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"to pay","l":"bezahlen"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"not yet"]]},{"text":"Die Strafe muss zum Verbrechen passen.","en":"The punishment must fit the crime.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"a felony"},{"g":"to fit"}]}]}